"index.unreadable.text" = "The vault's index.bin could not be read: it is damaged or belongs to another vault. The profile folders (%ld) are still there and are not deleted; the file is not written over, and no new profile is created until it is read. To get the profiles back, replace index.bin with a copy from a backup and restart Lumen. If this vault was synced before, you can instead rename index.bin (for example to index-damaged.bin), restart Lumen and choose Sync Now in the More menu.";
"index.unlisted.title" = "Some profile folders are not in the list";
"index.unlisted.text" = "Profile folders not in the profile list (index.bin): %ld. This happens when the list was replaced with an older copy, or made anew while the old one was missing. Nothing was deleted. These profiles' keys are only in a copy of index.bin that lists them. If you have one, keep the current index.bin aside, put that copy back and restart Lumen. Profiles made after that copy will then be outside the list; their folders are kept too.";
"index.reveal" = "Show in Finder";
"index.takenIn.text" = "The profile list (index.bin) was missing, or an older copy of it was put back. %ld profiles were put back into it from the copy of its key each profile keeps in its own folder, with their names; when each was last used is not known. Their data is as it was.";
